<title>USA: American Business Information names CFO.</title>
<headline>American Business Information names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Business Information Inc said it named Steven Purcell as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Purcell replaces Jon Wellman, who was promoted to president and chief operating officer in January.</p>
<p>Purcell was formerly the chief financial officer and treasurer at Micro Warehouse Inc, based in Norwalk, Conn.</p>
<p>American Business compiles information on businesses and consumers in the United States and Canada, and provides data processing and analytical services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
